  "title": "Betty&#39;s 3-Bean Hot Dish (a la Minnesota)",
  "description": "Comforting, hearty, meaty, and savory, this three-bean hot dish is perfect for potlucks, and it&#39;s easy to keep warm in the slow cooker.",
